Create a Python interface for our operator in the sycl_extension/ops.py file:
sycl_extension/ops.py
import torch from torch import Tensor __all__ = [ "mymuladd" ] def mymuladd ( a : Tensor , b : Tensor , c : float ) -> Tensor : """Performs a * b + c in an efficient fused kernel""" return torch . ops . sycl_extension . mymuladd . default ( a , b , c )

